('Valid Parentheses', 'Given a string s containing just the characters brackets, determine if the input string is valid.', 'easy', 'def isValid(s):\n    # write your code here', '[{"input":"()[]{}","expected_output":"true"}]', '[{"input":"()[]{}","expected_output":"true"}]', '[{"input":"(]","expected_output":"false"}]', 'A single string containing brackets', 'true or false', '1 <= s.length <= 10^4', '["string","stack"]', '["python","java","cpp","javascript"]', 10),
